wc_product_attributes_lookup now holds is_variation_attribute = 1 rows only for published variations: private, draft, pending and trashed variations get none, and a variation status change regenerates its rows. Code counting those rows to enumerate a product's variations will see fewer of them; is_variation_attribute = 0 rows are unchanged. A one-shot 11.3.0 database update deletes the rows already written for unpublished variations.
